message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Carbonation–CCU System Dynamics model (IS2H4C, Basque Hub)"
abstract: >-
  System Dynamics model of a CCU-enabled circular material flow in the Basque Hub:
  captured CO2 is used to carbonate pretreated steel slag in a pilot reactor, and the
  carbonated product is supplied to the cement sector. Includes the baseline model,
  verification scenarios S1-S4 and validation scenarios BV1-BV3 documented in
  IS2H4C Deliverable D4.3, Section 5.2.
